  "name": "PblRank1",
  "description": "Boundary-layer mixing toward the column mean (the reseact pbl_mean shape) plus per-cell O3-NO titration: on each (col) line along lev the state Jacobian is a per-level block (distance 0) plus one rank-one term per species, pblf[k]/tau times the mean's weights dp[j]*pblf[j]/W - the column_block plan's diag_plus_rank1 pattern (spec \u00a76)."
